---
source: crates/deft-cli/../../tests/unit/help.rs
expression: "help::group(g.name)"
---
deft md - commands (input -> output)
  from-docx  doc -> md      Convert to Markdown, keeping headings, lists and tables
  from-html  html -> md     Convert to Markdown; scripts and styles are dropped
  to-docx    md -> docx     Write a Word document with headings, lists, tables, images
  to-epub    md... -> epub  Make an e-book; each top-level heading starts a chapter
  to-html    md -> html     Render to a styled HTML page, or --fragment
  to-pdf     md -> pdf      Typeset Markdown as PDF
  toc        md -> md       Insert a table of contents from the headings
More: deft md <command> --help
